        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A small-pot window hanger holds one 8, 10 cm pot on a window curtain rod or a nail, with a 25 cm total hanging length. The cup is worked in close double crochet from a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "magic ring",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "; the hanging loop is a simple chain cord threaded through the rim. Sized for small herbs or succulents: basil, thyme, a small cactus."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
